# LocalOpsConsole — V2 Product

- **V2 at the repo root is the only product.** All feature work goes in `api/`, `core/`, `modules/`, `dashboard/`, `agent/`, `docs/`, `scripts/`, `data/` (and local `website/` for opsconsole.co.za deploys — not tracked on GitHub).
- **Do not recreate or extend** `v3/`, `website-v3/`, or `docs-v3/` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer improving V2 UX (Computers drawer, live telemetry, fleet agent) over greenfield rewrites.
- Feature gate: faster, safer, more informed?
- Keep the existing dark cyan/slate ops visual language unless redesigning intentionally.
- Before commit/push/release: follow `.cursor/rules/release-safety.mdc` (smokes + ZIP inspect).
